## Vue island (`src/ui/`)

One Vue app per leaf. `VueView.onOpen` creates the app, installs a **fresh
`createPinia()` and memory-history router per mount** (never module-level
singletons — a reopened leaf would inherit stale state), pushes the start route
(`await router.push('/')` — memory history has no initial navigation) so the
first paint renders the matched route, provides the `markRaw`'d plugin under
`PLUGIN_KEY`, and mounts. `onClose` calls
`app.unmount()` + `contentEl.empty()` — the #1 Obsidian+Vue leak is a view that
never unmounts.

- Use `<script setup lang="ts">`; type props with `defineProps<Props>()` and
  emits with the tuple form; template refs via `useTemplateRef()`.
- Inject the plugin through the typed `PLUGIN_KEY` (`keys.ts`) — don't
  prop-drill it.
- **Pinia**: setup stores (`counter.ts`); return every state ref and
  destructure with `storeToRefs()` to keep reactivity (actions destructure
  directly).
- **Composables** that create effects outliving a component wrap them in
  `effectScope()` / `onScopeDispose()`; `useGreeting` shows the simpler case —
  an event subscription cleaned up in `onUnmounted`.
- SFC `<style scoped>` blocks are merged into `styles.css` by the build.
